{"ticker":"FERG","updated":"2026-11-13T23:29:16Z","profile":{"longName":"Ferguson Enterprises Inc.","shortName":"Ferguson Enterprises Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Industrial Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.corporate.ferguson.com","fullTimeEmployees":36000,"marketCap":49665056768,"trailingPE":24.263956,"forwardPE":20.19355,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5410912,"pegRatio":1.61,"targetMeanPrice":290.54544,"targetHighPrice":325.0,"targetLowPrice":235.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.095,"earningsGrowth":-0.049,"grossMargins":0.30521,"operatingMargins":0.0861,"profitMargins":0.06043,"totalRevenue":32227201024,"beta":1.107,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":271.64,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":212.13,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.4},"summary":"Ferguson Enterprises Inc. distributes essential water and air solutions to specialized professional in the United States and Canada. The company provides various products and services, including plumbing; pipe, valves, and fittings; heating, ventilation, and air conditioning; appliances; lighting; and water and wastewater solutions to residential and non-residential customers. It also supplies specialized water and wastewater treatment products to residential, commercial, and infrastructure contractors, as well as supplies pipe, valves, and fittings solutions to industrial customers. In addition, it offers customized solutions, such as virtual design, fabrication, valve actuation, pre-assembly, kitting, installation, and project management services, as well as after-sales support that comprises warranty, credit, project-based billing, returns and maintenance, and repair and operations support. The company sells its products through a network of distribution centers, branches, counter service and sales associates, showroom consultants, and e-commerce channels. Ferguson Enterprises Inc. was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Newport News, Virginia.","summary_zh":"Ferguson Enterprises Inc. 為美國和加拿大的專業人士提供基本的水和空氣解決方案。該公司提供各種產品和服務，包括管道；管道、閥門和配件；暖氣、通風和空調；電器；燈光;以及為住宅和非住宅客戶提供水和廢水解決方案。它還為住宅、商業和基礎設施承包商提供專業的水和廢水處理產品，並為工業客戶提供管道、閥門和配件解決方案。此外，它還提供客製化解決方案，例如虛擬設計、製造、閥門驅動、預組裝、配套、安裝和專案管理服務，以及售後支持，包括保固、信貸、基於專案的計費、退貨和維護以及維修和營運支援。該公司透過配送中心、分公司、櫃檯服務和銷售人員、陳列室顧問和電子商務管道組成的網路銷售其產品。 Ferguson Enterprises Inc. 成立於 1953 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州紐波特紐斯。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"產業分佈","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-15","o":209.69,"h":215.28,"l":207.64,"c":214.53,"v":4034300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":235.2,"h":235.55,"l":224.17,"c":231.54,"v":5042100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":232.39,"h":232.69,"l":224.42,"c":224.48,"v":2827600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":226.33,"h":229.47,"l":224.17,"c":229.2,"v":2613700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":228.94,"h":229.7,"l":225.94,"c":229.41,"v":2885900},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":229.5,"h":233.7,"l":228.5,"c":233.03,"v":2277400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":235.4,"h":237.37,"l":232.47,"c":233.45,"v":1868300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":232.51,"h":232.7,"l":225.87,"c":226.44,"v":1459500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":224.69,"h":226.95,"l":223.74,"c":225.37,"v":1281600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":225.38,"h":225.99,"l":223.37,"c":225.88,"v":1295800},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":226.55,"h":226.55,"l":223.85,"c":225.0,"v":1500700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":224.61,"h":225.86,"l":223.17,"c":224.58,"v":2380100},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":225.73,"h":226.01,"l":223.87,"c":225.49,"v":1777000},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":227.13,"h":231.95,"l":226.49,"c":231.58,"v":2642200},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":230.0,"h":232.32,"l":230.0,"c":231.63,"v":1831700},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":232.55,"h":235.02,"l":229.2,"c":234.49,"v":1446900},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":236.63,"h":236.81,"l":230.96,"c":231.01,"v":825800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":231.68,"h":234.99,"l":230.15,"c":234.88,"v":1365200},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":234.06,"h":235.02,"l":232.23,"c":234.83,"v":1845800},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":235.18,"h":236.78,"l":230.92,"c":231.47,"v":1684200},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":231.51,"h":235.3,"l":231.05,"c":235.0,"v":1128300},{